meta {
  name: 12 - User Reliability Debug
  seq: 12
}

docs {
  Local/dev-only read endpoints for inspecting UserReliabilityScore while testing reliability events manually.

  Run 00 through 06 first. This mirrors the Android/counterpart Firebase setup used by flow 07: sign in, provision through /api/me/provision, then read /api/me to populate androidUserId and counterpartUserId.

  To inspect a user created by a different flow, set reliabilityUserId manually and run "12 Get Custom User Reliability".

  The endpoint is available only in local Spring profiles and returns a neutral score with an empty event list when user-reliability.enabled=false.

  These requests are read-only and do not create, recalculate, delete or mutate reliability events.
}
